<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 / 现状盘点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>三套“套路”编号体系与题型槽位覆盖</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E9E62' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>已实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={420} height={300} viewBox='0 0 420 300'><path d='M210.0 36.0 A108 108 0 1 1 158.0 238.6' fill='none' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='34'/><text x='357.2246404915519' y='185.80086284905792' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>有预定义步骤 58%</text><path d='M158.0 238.6 A108 108 0 0 1 210.0 36.0' fill='none' stroke='#CBD5E1' stroke-width='34'/><text x='62.775359508448105' y='110.19913715094197' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>步骤词表为空 42%</text><text x='210.0' y='142.0' font-size='30' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>12 类</text><text x='210.0' y='170.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>题型槽位</text></svg><svg width={700} height={130} viewBox='0 0 700 130'><rect x='0' y='10' width='700' height='104' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='350' y='40' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>三套编号体系互不等价：1019（目录）/ 29（正式训练）/ 288（课时库实体）</text><text x='350' y='74' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>引用数量时必须说明来自哪一套，避免把目录规模当成已开通的训练能力</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>读表提醒</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>有预定义步骤的 7 类：立体几何大题、解析几何大题、函数与导数大题、数列大题、解三角形大题、简单的概率统计大题、困难的概率大题。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>步骤词表为空的 5 类：选择题、多选题、填空题、其他非常规压轴大题、简单的非标准题目。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>一级步骤 99 个条目按题型作用域统计；二级步骤 359 条目仅按文字去重为 318，318 不是稳定 ID 数量。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>统计口径声明：本次为静态代码核对 + 本地库只读统计，未调用付费模型、未开展学生效果实验。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 13 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>